    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d102">

                <pb facs="0214" n="134" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg134"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Marroquin to President
                    Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>May it please your excellency to accept the expressions of condolence of the
                    Colombian Government and people for the demise of the illustrious President
                    McKinley.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">José Manuel Marroquin</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">President of Colombia.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
